{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も残りあと少し。\n私の今年、叶えたいこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ツアーを成功させること\n・写真集をより多くの方に手に取ってもうこと\n・笑顔をたくさんの方に届ける\n・たくさん笑う\n・一期一会を大切にする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これかな〜😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく来月から始まるツアーがすっごく楽しみ。どんな曲歌うかな？どんな構成になっているかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おひさまの皆さんに「あ〜！今年のライブは特に楽しかった〜」って言って貰えるようなライブをお届け出来るよう頑張ります💪🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"• ───── ✾ ───── •"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/17日発売の佐々木美玲1st写真集「陽射しのパレード」☀️🎪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🍞Amazon\nhttps://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4087901815/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🍞楽天ブックス限定\nhttps://books.rakuten.co.jp/rb/18033609/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🍞@Loppi・HMV限定\nhttps://www.hmv.co.jp/product/detail/15362447\n \n🍞紀伊國屋書店限定\nhttps://www.kinokuniya.co.jp/f/dsg-01-9784087901818\n "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式SNS▶︎▷XとTikTok\n「@panchanbook」是非フォローお願いします🫶🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6TVBAVX4M44Z1MZ11F4YZ3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"}],"source":"archive"}